  {"op": "index", "title": "Avatar kit look", "intro": "Produced by tools/render_jobs/jobs/avatar_kit_look.json. A new 150 ft temperate forest map (seed 1234) with a placed oak, saved as _avatarkit_forest and played; probes/avatar_kit.gd places figures assembled by AvatarKit from figurine's kit (res://assets/avatar_kit) with figurine's three judging recipes, drawn with shaders/avatar_figure.gdshader; frame times (perf.gd) for 0 / 8 / 30 figures at home and zoom 20 are in log.txt."},
